  "description": "Welcome to our guild!\n\nWe don&#039;t use discord.\n\nDuring the Yule Event all raids will be held in YuleWood Gardens. Combat LV 25 needed to participate. Raids held at 8am EST/ 10pm Japan &amp; 9pm EST/ 11am Japan. If enough challenges are completed there will also be a 7pm EST/ 9am Japan Raid.\n\nRaids are held around 11am Japan time(UTC+9)/ 9pm EST. Combat LV 60 needed to participate.\n\nThere are no duties, but if you don&#039;t log in for 7 days, you will be asked to leave the guild.\n\nゆっくりしていってね",
